      "reason_headline": "Adherence to Standard Reporting Format",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent correctly followed the specified format for trade updates, ensuring that all required information was included in the messages sent to Sarah."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Groundedness & Relevance",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Professional and Concise Communication",
      "reason_detailed": "The agent's communications were professional, concise, and directly relevant to the needs of the manager, Sarah, providing her with the necessary information to understand the trading activities and their rationale."
    },
    {
      "factor": "Completeness",
      "polarity": 1,
      "reason_headline": "Thorough Rationale for Trade Decisions",
